Ported from packages/concord-core (derive.ts, stream.ts, invite.ts,
edition.ts, version.ts, control.ts, roles.ts, community.ts, chat.ts,
communityList.ts, guestbook.ts, directInvite.ts) and packages/bridge
(concord/pool.ts, concord/client.ts, concord/keyIntake.ts). Changed from the original: cut to what a bridge reads
(no metadata, invite registry, pin, voice, rekey or snapshot handling),
rewritten in Go, and the relay pool written over gorilla/websocket.

testdata/upstream.json is output generated by running the original code.

